* {{IPA|en|/kəˈləʊ.kwɪəli/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/kəˈloʊ.kwi.əli/|a=GA}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[colloquial]] manner.
#: {{ux|en|Cattle, '''colloquially''' referred to as cows, are domesticated ungulates.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Joshua Korber Hoffman|title=The ‘Shinkansen kiss’: Japan’s little-known rail spectacle that attracts trainspotters from around the world|magazine=w:CNN|url=https://www.cnn.com/travel/shinkansen-kiss-japan-rail-spectacle-trainspotters-intl-hnk/index.html|date=2025-04-08|passage=The technical term for the event is “coupling,” but it is known '''colloquially''' as the “Shinkansen kiss.” For Japanese rail fans, it’s a big deal. For foreigners, it is a unique insight into the quintessentially Japanese experience of trainspotting.}}

